Assume count is 0 in the render that created this click handler, and no other updates occur. What count appears after this handler's updates are processed?

```tsx
function handleClick() {
  setCount(c => c + 1);
  setCount(count + 10);
  setCount(c => c * 2);
}
```

Assume count=0 in this render, no other updates, and all calls occur in one click handler. What state follows? How can the handler increment three times?

```tsx
function handleClick() {
  setCount(count + 1);
  setCount(count + 1);
  setCount(count + 1);
}
```
